  "details": "The \"Mouth & Jaw\" value in the Tracking Control persists even if the avatar is changed.\n\nIf you change the \"Mouth & Jaw\" value to \"Animation\" on one avatar and switch to an avatar with other visemes, the \"Mouth & Jaw\" value will be retained and visemes will not work on the avatar you switched to.\n\nHow it occurs:\n\n1. Use `avtr_bf6b05f2-44de-412c-9b2c-9ef0cfd20af6`\n\n2. Open the avatar's debugging UI and check that \"Mouth & Jaw\" in Tracking Control is set to \"Animation\"\n\n3. Change the avatar to one with having visemes feature\n\n4. Unmute and speak something, You will realize that mouth is not moving\n\nVideo:\n\nhttps://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1124037765181493320/1194585310844166174/visemes.mp4\n\nVideo (if the above link is unavailable):\n\nhttps://i.imgur.com/Z27y9Yp.mp4",
